      "message": "[warning] Line 926: 🟡 The default RTCP feedback behavior is disabled whenever `previousLocalSession` is non-null, even for newly added media sections that have no prior local m-line (`mediaIndex \u003e\u003d previousLocalSession-\u003emedia_count`). In that case, feedback/extmap capabilities (transport-cc/goog-remb/nack/pli/fir) can be dropped unexpectedly on re-INVITE. Base this branch on `previousLocalMedia` (per-m-line availability), and fall back to first-offer defaults when no prior m-line exists.",
