      "side": 1,
      "message": "[error] Line 751: 🔴 `previousLocalSession` is captured, then `setActiveLocalSdpSession(nullptr)` is called before `createOffer(..., previousLocalSession)`. If clearing the active SDP releases that session storage, `createOffer` dereferences a dangling pointer (use-after-free risk) while reading previous media/transport parameters. Keep the previous SDP alive through offer generation (e.g., deep-copy it before clearing, or postpone clearing active local SDP until after `createOffer` succeeds).",
